GEMINI_API_KEY="your-gemini-api-key"
Ensure ffmpeg is installed on your OS (brew install ffmpeg on macOS, sudo apt install ffmpeg on Linux, or via winget on Windows).
Install dependencies and start the API:
code
Bash
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
2. Configure Frontend
In the frontend folder, install packages and start the Vite dev server:
code
Bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
