Speak naturally into Step 2 with conversational fillers ("um, like, basically"). Watch Gemini calculate metrics, formulate the unapologetic Peterson audit, and generate the refined script.
Click "Re-Synthesize in Cloned Voice" to listen to the new voice output side-by-side with your raw recording[1][2].